cff-version: 1.2.0
title: kat-coder-nvfp4
abstract: >-
  A REAP expert-pruned (50%) and NVFP4-quantized build of
  Kwaipilot/KAT-Coder-V2.5-Dev, served by vLLM inside 16 GB of consumer VRAM
  on an RTX 5070 Ti (SM120). Two checkpoints are published: NVFP4A16
  (weight-only, 12.45 GiB, this release's default) and NVFP4 W4A4
  (weights+activations, native FP4 kernels). Includes a router-renormalization
  fix for the qwen3_5_moe REAP adapter, and published SWE-bench Verified,
  HumanEval+ and MBPP+ figures with confidence intervals.
type: software
message: >-
  If you use this checkpoint, please also cite the upstream KAT-Coder-V2.5
  technical report (arXiv:2607.05471), from which it is derived.
authors:
  - name: t-timms
repository-code: https://github.com/t-timms/kat-coder-nvfp4
url: https://huggingface.co/Ttimms/KAT-Coder-V2.5-Dev-REAP-50-NVFP4A16
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - expert-pruning
  - reap
  - nvfp4
  - quantization
  - mixture-of-experts
  - vllm
  - agentic-coding
references:
